---
import { getRelativeLocaleUrl } from "astro:i18n"
import config from "../../config.mjs"

const locale = Astro.currentLocale || "root"
const docsHref = getRelativeLocaleUrl(locale, "")
const cliHref = getRelativeLocaleUrl(locale, "cli")
const agentsHref = getRelativeLocaleUrl(locale, "agents")
const providersHref = getRelativeLocaleUrl(locale, "providers")

const installCommand = "npm i -g @agent-qofeno/agentx-cli@latest"
---

<div class="agentx-lander">
  <header class="site-nav">
    <a class="brand" href={docsHref} aria-label="AgentX Code home">
      <span class="brand-mark" aria-hidden="true">X</span>
      <span>AgentX <em>Code</em></span>
    </a>

    <nav aria-label="Primary navigation">
      <a href={docsHref}>Docs</a>
      <a href={agentsHref}>Agents</a>
      <a href={providersHref}>Providers</a>
      <a class="nav-github" href={config.github} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">GitHub ↗</a>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <main>
    <section class="hero">
      <div class="hero-copy">
        <p class="eyebrow"><span class="pulse"></span> OPEN SOURCE · TERMINAL FIRST</p>
        <h1>Build with an agent that can see the <span>whole project.</span></h1>
        <p class="lede">
          AgentX Code reads the repository, plans the work, changes the right files,
          and keeps the workflow close to your terminal.
        </p>

        <div class="actions">
          <a class="button primary" href={cliHref}>Install AgentX</a>
          <a class="button secondary" href={docsHref}>Read the docs</a>
        </div>

        <div class="install">
          <span class="prompt">$</span>
          <code>{installCommand}</code>
          <button class="copy" type="button" data-command={installCommand} aria-label="Copy install command">Copy</button>
        </div>
        <p class="install-note">Then run <code>agentx</code> in any repository.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="terminal-card" aria-label="AgentX terminal preview">
        <div class="terminal-top">
          <div class="dots"><i></i><i></i><i></i></div>
          <span>agentx · ~/project</span>
          <span class="live">● live</span>
        </div>
        <div class="terminal-body">
          <div class="terminal-line dim">$ agentx</div>
          <div class="terminal-line"><span class="green">›</span> Inspecting repository</div>
          <div class="terminal-line"><span class="green">›</span> Reading architecture and project rules</div>
          <div class="terminal-line"><span class="green">›</span> Building an implementation plan</div>
          <div class="plan-box">
            <div><span>01</span> Update auth flow</div>
            <div><span>02</span> Add session coverage</div>
            <div><span>03</span> Run checks</div>
          </div>
          <div class="terminal-line ready"><span class="green">✓</span> Plan ready <span class="cursor"></span></div>
        </div>
        <div class="terminal-footer">
          <span>Tab</span> switch agent <span>·</span> <span>Enter</span> approve
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="proof">
      <div>
        <span class="proof-kicker">01</span>
        <h2>Understand before you edit.</h2>
        <p>AgentX is built around repository context instead of isolated prompts. It explores the project first, then proposes a concrete path forward.</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <span class="proof-kicker">02</span>
        <h2>Plan without touching files.</h2>
        <p>The built-in plan agent is read-only, so you can inspect an unfamiliar codebase and review the approach before execution.</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <span class="proof-kicker">03</span>
        <h2>Keep control of execution.</h2>
        <p>Switch back to the build agent when the plan is right. Your terminal remains the source of truth for the work.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="feature-section">
      <div class="section-heading">
        <p class="eyebrow">THE WORKFLOW</p>
        <h2>One agent. Four deliberate steps.</h2>
      </div>

      <div class="feature-grid">
        <a class="feature" href={docsHref}>
          <span class="number">01</span>
          <strong>Read</strong>
          <p>Map the repository, conventions, dependencies, and relevant files.</p>
          <span class="arrow">↗</span>
        </a>
        <a class="feature" href={agentsHref}>
          <span class="number">02</span>
          <strong>Plan</strong>
          <p>Use a read-only agent to turn context into an actionable implementation plan.</p>
          <span class="arrow">↗</span>
        </a>
        <a class="feature" href={cliHref}>
          <span class="number">03</span>
          <strong>Execute</strong>
          <p>Let the build agent make focused changes from inside the project.</p>
          <span class="arrow">↗</span>
        </a>
        <a class="feature" href={cliHref}>
          <span class="number">04</span>
          <strong>Verify</strong>
          <p>Run the project checks that prove the change works before you call it done.</p>
          <span class="arrow">↗</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="agents-strip">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">BUILT-IN AGENTS</p>
        <h2>Plan or build. Stay in the same session.</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="agent-pill"><span class="agent-dot plan"></span><div><b>plan</b><small>read-only exploration</small></div></div>
      <div class="agent-pill"><span class="agent-dot build"></span><div><b>build</b><small>full development access</small></div></div>
      <div class="agent-pill"><span class="agent-dot general"></span><div><b>general</b><small>deep search &amp; multistep work</small></div></div>
    </section>

    <section class="closing">
      <p class="eyebrow">START WITH YOUR REPOSITORY</p>
      <h2>Give the codebase a seat at the table.</h2>
      <div class="actions">
        <a class="button primary" href={cliHref}>Get AgentX</a>
        <a class="button secondary" href={config.github} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">View source ↗</a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer class="site-footer">
    <span>AgentX Code · open source</span>
    <div>
      <a href={config.github} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">GitHub</a>
      <a href={config.discord} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Discussions</a>
    </div>
  </footer>
</div>

<script>
  const button = document.querySelector<HTMLButtonElement>(".copy")
  button?.addEventListener("click", async () => {
    await navigator.clipboard.writeText(button.dataset.command || "")
    button.textContent = "Copied"
    setTimeout(() => (button.textContent = "Copy"), 1400)
  })
</script>

<style>
  .agentx-lander {
    --ink: #11110f;
    --paper: #f5f5f0;
    --muted: #6c6c64;
    --line: #d8d8d0;
    --panel: #181816;
    --green: #b7f34a;
    min-height: 100vh;
    background: var(--paper);
    color: var(--ink);
    font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", sans-serif;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .site-nav,
  main > section,
  .site-footer {
    width: min(1180px, calc(100% - 48px));
    margin-inline: auto;
  }

  .site-nav {
    min-height: 76px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
  }

  .brand {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
    color: var(--ink) !important;
    text-decoration: none !important;
    font-weight: 750;
    letter-spacing: -0.04em;
    font-size: 17px;
  }

  .brand em { font-style: normal; color: #77776f; font-weight: 500; }

  .brand-mark {
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    width: 28px;
    height: 28px;
    border: 2px solid var(--ink);
    font-weight: 900;
    font-size: 13px;
    transform: rotate(45deg);
  }

  .brand-mark::first-letter { transform: rotate(-45deg); }

  .site-nav nav { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 28px; }
  .site-nav nav a { color: #55554e !important; text-decoration: none !important; font-size: 14px; }
  .site-nav nav a:hover { color: var(--ink) !important; }
  .site-nav .nav-github { color: var(--ink) !important; }

  .hero {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(420px, .92fr);
    gap: 76px;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 100px 0 110px;
  }

  .eyebrow {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 9px;
    margin: 0 0 20px;
    font-size: 11px;
    line-height: 1;
    letter-spacing: .16em;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: #707068;
  }

  .pulse {
    width: 7px;
    height: 7px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: #5b8f00;
    box-shadow: 0 0 0 4px rgba(183,243,74,.35);
  }

  h1 {
    max-width: 680px;
    margin: 0;
    font-size: clamp(52px, 6vw, 84px) !important;
    line-height: .96;
    letter-spacing: -.065em;
    font-weight: 720 !important;
    color: var(--ink) !important;
  }

  h1 span { color: #74746c; }

  .lede {
    max-width: 610px;
    margin: 28px 0 0;
    color: #5f5f58;
    font-size: 18px;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .actions { display: flex; gap: 10px; flex-wrap: wrap; margin-top: 30px; }
  .button {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    min-height: 46px;
    padding: 0 18px;
    border: 1px solid #bdbdb5;
    border-radius: 6px;
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-decoration: none !important;
    transition: transform .16s ease, background .16s ease, border-color .16s ease;
  }
  .button:hover { transform: translateY(-1px); }
  .button.primary { background: var(--ink); border-color: var(--ink); color: var(--paper) !important; }
  .button.secondary { color: var(--ink) !important; background: transparent; }

  .install {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 11px;
    max-width: 610px;
    margin-top: 34px;
    padding: 13px 14px;
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    background: #ededE6;
    border-radius: 6px;
  }
  .install .prompt { color: #5d8b12; font-weight: 800; }
  .install code { flex: 1; overflow: auto; white-space: nowrap; font: 13px/1.4 ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace; color: #2d2d29; }
  .copy { border: 0; background: transparent; color: #707068; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; cursor: pointer; }
  .install-note { margin: 9px 0 0 3px; color: #8a8a81; font-size: 12px; }
  .install-note code { font: inherit; color: #4d4d46; }

  .terminal-card {
    background: var(--panel);
    color: #f4f4ed;
    border-radius: 10px;
    box-shadow: 0 28px 70px rgba(18,18,15,.18);
    overflow: hidden;
    transform: rotate(.6deg);
  }

  .terminal-top, .terminal-footer {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
    min-height: 44px;
    padding: 0 16px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #2e2e2a;
    color: #7f7f77;
    font-size: 11px;
  }
  .terminal-footer { border-top: 1px solid #2e2e2a; border-bottom: 0; }
  .dots { display: flex; gap: 5px; margin-right: 6px; }
  .dots i { width: 7px; height: 7px; border-radius: 50%; background: #4a4a44; }
  .live { margin-left: auto; color: var(--green); }
  .terminal-body { padding: 28px 22px 34px; min-height: 320px; font: 13px/1.85 ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace; }
  .terminal-line { color: #d8d8d0; }
  .terminal-line.dim { color: #6f6f68; margin-bottom: 8px; }
  .terminal-line.ready { margin-top: 16px; color: #f2f2eb; }
  .green { color: var(--green); }
  .plan-box { margin: 16px 0 4px 17px; padding: 13px 15px; border: 1px solid #363630; background: #1d1d1a; }
  .plan-box div + div { margin-top: 3px; }
  .plan-box span { display: inline-block; width: 25px; color: #6f6f68; }
  .cursor { display: inline-block; width: 7px; height: 14px; margin-left: 3px; vertical-align: -2px; background: var(--green); animation: blink 1s steps(1) infinite; }
  @keyframes blink { 50% { opacity: 0; } }

  .proof {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
  }
  .proof > div { padding: 32px 28px 36px 0; }
  .proof > div + div { padding-left: 28px; border-left: 1px solid var(--line); }
  .proof-kicker, .number { color: #898980; font: 11px ui-monospace, monospace; }
  .proof h2, .feature-section h2, .agents-strip h2, .closing h2 {
    margin: 12px 0 9px;
    font-size: 22px !important;
    line-height: 1.15;
    letter-spacing: -.035em;
    font-weight: 650 !important;
    color: var(--ink) !important;
  }
  .proof p, .feature p { margin: 0; color: #6a6a62; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 14px; }

  .feature-section { padding: 115px 0; }
  .section-heading { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: end; gap: 40px; margin-bottom: 38px; }
  .section-heading .eyebrow { margin: 0; }
  .section-heading h2 { max-width: 520px; margin: 0; font-size: 40px !important; }

  .feature-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); border-top: 1px solid var(--line); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); }
  .feature { position: relative; min-height: 230px; padding: 24px 22px 24px 0; color: var(--ink) !important; text-decoration: none !important; }
  .feature + .feature { padding-left: 22px; border-left: 1px solid var(--line); }
  .feature strong { display: block; margin: 48px 0 10px; font-size: 21px; letter-spacing: -.03em; }
  .feature .arrow { position: absolute; right: 0; top: 23px; color: #8b8b82; }
  .feature:hover .arrow { color: var(--ink); }

  .agents-strip {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.6fr repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 14px;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 30px 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
  }
  .agents-strip h2 { margin-bottom: 0; }
  .agent-pill { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; padding: 13px 14px; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 6px; background: #efefe8; }
  .agent-dot { width: 8px; height: 8px; border-radius: 50%; }
  .agent-dot.plan { background: #9d9d95; }
  .agent-dot.build { background: #7eae25; }
  .agent-dot.general { background: #34342f; }
  .agent-pill b { display: block; font-size: 13px; }
  .agent-pill small { display: block; margin-top: 2px; color: #808078; font-size: 10px; }

  .closing { text-align: center; padding: 135px 0 120px; }
  .closing .eyebrow { justify-content: center; }
  .closing h2 { max-width: 760px; margin: 0 auto; font-size: clamp(42px, 5vw, 68px) !important; letter-spacing: -.055em; }
  .closing .actions { justify-content: center; }

  .site-footer {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    padding: 22px 0 34px;
    color: #88887f;
    font-size: 12px;
  }
  .site-footer div { display: flex; gap: 22px; }
  .site-footer a { color: #66665f !important; text-decoration: none !important; }
  .site-footer a:hover { color: var(--ink) !important; }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .hero { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 48px; padding: 72px 0 80px; }
    .terminal-card { max-width: 720px; transform: none; }
    .proof { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .proof > div, .proof > div + div { padding: 28px 0; border-left: 0; }
    .proof > div + div { border-top: 1px solid var(--line); }
    .feature-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
    .feature:nth-child(3) { border-left: 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); padding-left: 0; }
    .feature:nth-child(4) { border-top: 1px solid var(--line); }
    .agents-strip { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .site-nav, main > section, .site-footer { width: min(100% - 28px, 1180px); }
    .site-nav { min-height: 66px; }
    .site-nav nav { gap: 14px; }
    .site-nav nav a:nth-child(2), .site-nav nav a:nth-child(3) { display: none; }
    .hero { padding: 58px 0 66px; }
    h1 { font-size: clamp(46px, 14vw, 64px) !important; }
    .lede { font-size: 16px; }
    .feature-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .feature, .feature + .feature { padding: 22px 0; border-left: 0; }
    .feature + .feature { border-top: 1px solid var(--line); }
    .feature strong { margin-top: 34px; }
    .section-heading { display: block; }
    .section-heading h2 { margin-top: 18px; font-size: 34px !important; }
    .closing { padding: 90px 0 80px; }
    .site-footer { display: block; }
    .site-footer div { margin-top: 12px; }
  }
</style>
